Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:07.20,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}伸出雙手 我接著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:09.27,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}伸出雙手 迎接成功
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:11.95,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}為此付出全部努力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.19,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}遊戲結束 但他們令他超越自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:18.34,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}溝裡那鼻子流著血的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:20.45,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}如今出現他未曾讀過的報刊封面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:21.49,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}頭條新聞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.49,0:23:22.40,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}頭條新聞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.40,0:23:24.64,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}身材健實 但他並未驕傲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:26.82,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}本土男孩 從零崛起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:28.99,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}每場戰鬥 我們都會目睹他能量的提升
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:29.89,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}不斷增長
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:31.02,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}想贏就去拼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:13.99,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Can't remember to forget
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:15.68,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Little boy who lost the bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:18.24,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Now I'm racking up the kills
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:20.27,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}I got to pay the bills, the bills
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.48,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Short cut to be a star
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:24.74,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Wasn't born to raise the bar
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:26.62,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}誤魔化しの正義は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.14,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}誰も起こせないアラームのようだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:31.33,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Failing feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:33.44,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}喜怒哀楽をクリーンにしないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:35.70,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}声を Free に
