Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.86,0:22:39.60,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}So givin' yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:40.62,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Ya givin' yourself
