Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.25,0:22:48.30,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Don't you gotta get solo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.67,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}What you gonna get
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:50.52,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Swear it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.79,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Don't you dare forget Solo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.79,0:22:54.68,ED - JP - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,540)}Ya give it your best shot
